  {"op": "note", "text": "Path (Hardin made Elder): the brotherhood chain's walk through Still in the Dark to the three lost patrols' discs (copied from brotherhood.actions.json, stand-ins as noted there); Hardin asks for help ousting McNamara (VMS55 objectives 50-52); Ramos is told (51) and later asked about the Chain That Binds (53); the datastore's Elder dismissal incidents (52) and Chain That Binds entry (54) are read; Hardin hears of the Chain and of the patrols' discs and calls the vote of no confidence (VMS55 101); the settling fade makes him Elder. He then sets the player's task for joining (VMS55a 10): the Van Graffs and their men killed (the quest script sees eight dead, 20); Hardin's thanks (objective 19) and the power armour training (100)."},
